{"t":"023530.KS","n":"Lotte Shopping Co., Ltd.","nKo":"(주)롯데쇼핑","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":77900.0,"chg":1600.0,"chgPct":0.02097,"prev":76300.0,"dayH":78200.0,"dayL":75500.0,"w52H":211000.0,"w52L":67800.0,"vol":80820,"avgVol":85482,"mcap":2202282754048,"pe":null,"fpe":5.64,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":4100.0,"divY":0.0537,"beta":0.62,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Consumer Cyclical","sKo":"소비자 경기순환","i":"Department Stores","iKo":"백화점","city":"Seoul","emp":null,"web":"https://www.lotteshoppingir.com","sum":"Lotte Shopping Co., Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, owns and manages department stores in South Korea. It also operates outlets, discount stores, electronics stores, supermarkets, e-commerce, and movie theaters. In addition, the company is involved in the TV home shopping, clothing manufacturing and sales, home appliance retail, and movie screening businesses; provision of building management service; real estate, new technology investment, financial, and film investment production activities. The company was formerly known as Hyupwoo Industrial Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Lotte Shopping Co., Ltd. in November 1979. Lotte Shopping Co., Ltd. was founded in 1970 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","sumKo":"롯데쇼핑주식회사는 자회사와 함께 대한민국에서 백화점을 소유 및 관리하고 있습니다. 또한 아울렛, 할인점, 전자제품 매장, 슈퍼마켓, 전자상거래, 영화관도 운영하고 있습니다. 또한 TV홈쇼핑, 의류제조판매, 가전제품 소매업, 영화상영사업 등을 영위하고 있습니다. 건물 관리 서비스 제공; 부동산, 신기술 투자, 금융, 영화 투자 제작 활동을 하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 협우산업주식회사로 알려졌으며 1979년 11월에 롯데쇼핑주식회사로 상호를 변경했습니다. 롯데쇼핑주식회사는 1970년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":15476035660000,"ni":-306710000000},{"y":2023,"rev":14555864000000,"ni":182225000000},{"y":2024,"rev":13986578000000,"ni":-958203000000},{"y":2025,"rev":13738355000000,"ni":51556000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":3521825000000,"ni":112364000000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":3581595000000,"ni":128215000000},{"q":"2Q2026","rev":3485028000000,"ni":